WEBVTT

01:35.271 --> 01:38.263
Who will walk away victorious?!

01:38.641 --> 01:40.336
We will soon find out!

01:41.611 --> 01:43.078
Fight!

01:45.414 --> 01:50.113
The Masquerade Ball of Zaza Part 3

01:56.259 --> 01:58.318
And the main event gets
off to a roaring start!

01:58.628 --> 02:00.730
It looks like they are sizing each
other up and planning their

02:00.730 --> 02:02.561
respective strategies
with lightning speed.

02:03.099 --> 02:05.067
The main event of this year's
Masquerade Fighter's Ball

02:05.067 --> 02:06.802
is finally underway! The Warrior of
the Rising Son and Wonder Boy

02:06.802 --> 02:08.604
are both fighting with
their lives on the line

02:08.604 --> 02:12.199
to be victorious in this final bout.

02:13.109 --> 02:15.578
The Rising Son has his body covered
from head to toe in heavy armor!

02:15.578 --> 02:17.446
This makes it impossible for the Boy

02:17.446 --> 02:20.643
to read the Son's facial expressions
and body movements!

02:21.384 --> 02:23.786
As for the Boy, he wears nothing
even remotely resembling armor

02:23.786 --> 02:25.549
and appears defenseless in
front of his formidable foe.

02:43.940 --> 02:45.407
That's amazing!

02:59.488 --> 03:02.225
Oh man, what a fight!

03:02.225 --> 03:04.716
You don't know what you're doing!
This fight's far from over!

03:17.240 --> 03:19.075
As the night approaches,

03:19.075 --> 03:20.872
they continue to fight
harder and harder!

03:21.444 --> 03:23.776
This is quickly becoming the best
fight I have ever witnessed!

03:24.981 --> 03:27.211
They both struggle harder and harder
and never seem to grow weary.

03:27.583 --> 03:29.051
They've been at it now for five hours
and not one person has left!

03:29.051 --> 03:30.678
Every last person in the crowd
is glued to this spectacle!

03:32.888 --> 03:34.355
Incredible!

03:37.727 --> 03:39.524
Everyone is too excited to go home.

03:39.996 --> 03:44.160
I've never seen a fight as beautiful
as this one in all my years.

03:44.767 --> 03:46.564
I am at a loss for words.

03:46.936 --> 03:49.005
Their bodies should not be able
to take this for much longer.

03:49.005 --> 03:52.338
Any normal person would have
died from exhaustion by now.

03:53.576 --> 03:57.410
It's almost like they're
dancing together.

04:14.964 --> 04:18.567
All right, it's finally over! The sun
has risen and now it has set.

04:18.567 --> 04:20.899
Looks like Jing has won!

04:33.883 --> 04:35.316
Cube!

04:45.394 --> 04:46.861
It can't be...

04:53.536 --> 04:55.026
Stir!

05:10.753 --> 05:12.220
Miss!

05:26.635 --> 05:31.299
This can't be! The Warrior of
the Rising Son is a girl?!

05:53.496 --> 05:56.624
There is no longer any need
to keep your mask on!

06:04.807 --> 06:06.297
We'll get you!

06:10.012 --> 06:11.877
Miss, Miss...

06:12.581 --> 06:14.048
C'mon!

06:14.950 --> 06:17.544
Miss, Miss...

06:18.087 --> 06:19.748
Miss!

06:27.229 --> 06:29.857
Stir, why did you have to...

06:32.134 --> 06:34.227
Stir, answer me.

06:35.571 --> 06:37.596
Open your eyes, please.

06:40.776 --> 06:43.609
Stir, what did you say?
Did you just say something?

06:53.589 --> 06:56.752
It's here! The time
has finally come!

06:57.626 --> 07:00.496
The ringleader behind the plot

07:00.496 --> 07:02.123
to assassinate the Madame
has finally been exposed!

07:03.332 --> 07:06.202
Even though he is only a child, he
will receive the death penalty

07:06.202 --> 07:08.762
for aiming for the life of the Madame,
the worst crime imaginable!

07:09.872 --> 07:12.170
Hey, Jing, are they going
to put you away?

07:12.675 --> 07:14.142
I think so.

07:15.244 --> 07:17.012
Don't take off the Mask of Death!

07:17.012 --> 07:17.580
Leave it on!

07:17.580 --> 07:18.180
Leave it on!
Leave it on!

07:18.180 --> 07:19.081
Leave it on!
Leave it one! Don't take it off!

07:19.081 --> 07:19.114
Leave it one! Don't take it off!

07:19.114 --> 07:19.748
Quit copying me!

07:19.748 --> 07:20.516
Quit copying me!
Quit copying me!

07:20.516 --> 07:21.250
Quit copying me!
Quit copying me!

07:21.250 --> 07:22.012
Quit copying me!

07:24.253 --> 07:25.686
Baffle...

07:27.423 --> 07:28.557
Back off!

07:28.557 --> 07:28.924
Settle down, kid. We're
on the same side.
Back off!

07:28.924 --> 07:32.228
Settle down, kid. We're
on the same side.

07:32.228 --> 07:34.628
But I'm not quite as
forgiving as you are.

07:34.964 --> 07:37.626
This guy tried to kill the Madame!

07:37.867 --> 07:40.062
And for that he deserves
a thousand deaths!

07:45.841 --> 07:49.078
Are you good at cooking fowl? I
can assure you I taste horrible!

07:49.078 --> 07:51.046
But I have been told I'm sweet
when in a woman's mouth.

07:51.347 --> 07:53.577
Stop it, Baffle! If you don't stop...

07:55.851 --> 07:58.217
Nothing can save you now, kid.

07:58.888 --> 08:00.489
Unfortunately for you,

08:00.489 --> 08:01.956
I have all the tools I need to
cook any meal right here.

08:02.791 --> 08:05.157
As you can see,
everything's ready to go!

08:07.997 --> 08:09.760
You will soon see the
extent of my power.

08:09.999 --> 08:11.634
Sounds nice.

08:11.634 --> 08:13.261
What's the meaning of this, Baffle?

08:13.569 --> 08:15.404
He's going to be punished,
so don't worry about that!

08:15.404 --> 08:16.871
Punished?

08:17.640 --> 08:19.041
I'll punish him!

08:19.041 --> 08:21.677
When I'm done with him, he'll
be too tired to open his eyes!

08:21.677 --> 08:24.237
I'll cut him so badly, all the blood
in his body will dry up.

08:25.481 --> 08:26.882
His body will be so full of fear,

08:26.882 --> 08:28.543
he won't be able to move. That's
how I'm going to punish him!

08:29.385 --> 08:33.617
He isn't even human. He must
be some kind of demon!

08:33.989 --> 08:36.958
This little devil is going to bring
ruin to the town of Zaza!

08:38.093 --> 08:39.583
And I am here to
perform the exorcism!

08:46.168 --> 08:47.635
Devil...

08:48.037 --> 08:49.504
Devil?

08:51.173 --> 08:53.075
It is his fault that Miss Stir is
in her present condition.

08:53.075 --> 08:56.306
This is just the beginning
of his ruin of this town!

08:57.413 --> 09:02.043
We must destroy him before he is
able to do anything else to us!

09:12.428 --> 09:13.918
Stop right there!

09:14.897 --> 09:18.333
I can't let you do whatever you want
to him. That is not the law!

09:19.001 --> 09:20.536
If a public execution
is what you want,

09:20.536 --> 09:22.265
I'll kill you both right now!

09:23.272 --> 09:26.730
The least we can do is
give him a fair trial!

09:31.380 --> 09:33.746
How about it, kid?

09:35.017 --> 09:37.419
Which way do you want to die?
Though the system,

09:37.419 --> 09:39.216
or in a duel like a man?!

09:41.857 --> 09:43.290
What'll it be, kid?!

09:45.260 --> 09:47.956
I know you want another chance
at making a meal out of me.

09:50.366 --> 09:53.130
No problem, why don't we
have dinner together?

09:59.141 --> 10:03.077
Mama, I'm doing my best.

10:04.647 --> 10:07.172
I know I can never replace Lemon.

10:07.650 --> 10:09.948
But I try hard for him too.

10:10.953 --> 10:13.751
If I become the champion,
could you please...

10:14.189 --> 10:17.750
I'd love it if you would choose me.

10:21.163 --> 10:23.631
Please, Mama?

10:26.568 --> 10:28.035
Please...

10:33.609 --> 10:35.076
Stir...

10:47.723 --> 10:50.025
The sun is about to rise,

10:50.025 --> 10:52.789
but not one spectator has
left the arena all night!

10:53.762 --> 10:57.232
This will be a great battle
of life and death,

10:57.232 --> 10:59.792
the likes of which our crowd
here has never seen.

11:00.302 --> 11:04.102
It appears that the entire town is
here in the corrida right now!

11:04.606 --> 11:06.775
We all await what will perhaps be

11:06.775 --> 11:09.243
the final appearance of
our Wonder Boy.

11:10.279 --> 11:11.680
Hey, what's going on?!

11:11.680 --> 11:12.881
Where is he?

11:12.881 --> 11:12.981
Let's get on with it already!
Where is he?

11:12.981 --> 11:14.414
Let's get on with it already!

11:16.251 --> 11:17.980
Everyone needs to just calm down.

11:19.121 --> 11:21.323
I'm almost done with
my pre-fight feast.

11:21.323 --> 11:23.092
The crowd here needs to start showing

11:23.092 --> 11:25.287
a little more respect for the fight.

11:31.233 --> 11:32.700
And here he is.

11:57.192 --> 11:58.694
It's already morning?

11:58.694 --> 12:00.161
The morning has come.

12:01.630 --> 12:04.190
This truly is a blessed star.

12:05.100 --> 12:08.900
It has been perfect for
millions of years.

12:09.271 --> 12:11.262
Never too close or too far away...

12:11.807 --> 12:13.798
Never too hot or too cold...

12:14.676 --> 12:19.306
I can always rely on the sun. He is
always there to gaze back at me.

12:23.919 --> 12:25.716
I have been such a fool.

12:28.624 --> 12:31.320
I have nothing but regret
inside my heart.

12:32.828 --> 12:34.318
I've never before even taken the time

12:34.563 --> 12:36.428
to notice the simple
beauty of a sunrise.

12:41.470 --> 12:43.335
And the danger that it brings...

12:50.279 --> 12:54.079
I can't believe that I almost lost
another child because of it.

13:00.155 --> 13:01.622
Water...

13:03.058 --> 13:05.458
Water! Bring me some water!

13:14.369 --> 13:16.234
You about ready now, kid?

13:22.477 --> 13:24.046
No, please...

13:24.046 --> 13:25.479
Get on with it!

13:29.017 --> 13:30.382
It's already started?

14:02.584 --> 14:04.984
Looks like the kid can't
really hold his own.

14:05.220 --> 14:07.055
This will be a tragedy if he doesn't
return an attack soon!

14:07.055 --> 14:09.080
Who would have ever suspected this?!

14:10.192 --> 14:12.217
Didn't you know that cooking
requires incredible skill?!

14:13.262 --> 14:16.026
Well, before I finish you off...

14:37.719 --> 14:41.155
How long have I been out?

14:46.528 --> 14:49.725
Angostura! What are
you doing here?!

14:50.132 --> 14:51.622
Where are you going?

14:52.601 --> 14:55.069
Stop ignoring me and say
something already!

15:48.390 --> 15:49.823
Stir...

15:58.266 --> 15:59.733
What's wrong, Stir?

16:12.781 --> 16:14.271
Mama...

16:16.118 --> 16:18.687
After I take this devil mask off of you,

16:18.687 --> 16:21.520
I'm gonna stuff and mount
you like a little deer!

16:25.927 --> 16:28.555
Hey, this isn't him!
This is Angostura!

16:32.901 --> 16:35.670
It was him! It was that damn bandit!

16:35.670 --> 16:37.773
He stole the Vintage Smile!

16:37.773 --> 16:39.240
The Vintage Smile?

16:39.574 --> 16:42.077
That kid completely tricked all of us!

16:42.077 --> 16:44.944
He is the Bandit King!

16:45.380 --> 16:46.548
The Bandit King?!

16:46.548 --> 16:49.151
He set up this fight as a diversion

16:49.151 --> 16:51.745
to get the guards away
from the palace!

16:53.255 --> 16:54.722
No!

16:55.390 --> 16:58.655
It's not our fault. We thought
he was Mr. Angostura.

17:00.562 --> 17:03.030
I have to hurry and tell Madame Earl!

17:05.200 --> 17:07.430
Madame Earl! Miss Stir!

17:09.738 --> 17:14.141
Madame Earl! I am incredibly sorry,
but the Vintage Smile has...

17:15.343 --> 17:16.810
Angostura?

17:18.013 --> 17:23.747
It's okay. It's all right. He didn't
take the Vintage Smile.

17:25.287 --> 17:26.720
I'm so relieved.

17:27.823 --> 17:30.257
Madame Earl is wearing
it as we speak.

17:39.067 --> 17:40.534
Bingo!

17:40.936 --> 17:42.870
Hey, Jing, check it out!

17:44.406 --> 17:46.567
I always suspected that he
shared our profession.

17:51.079 --> 17:51.947
Ginjou!

17:51.947 --> 17:54.049
Hey, so you're the Bandit King

17:54.049 --> 17:55.984
that can supposedly steal
the stars out of the sky?

17:55.984 --> 17:57.884
Now I believe all the rumors
about your skill.

17:58.220 --> 18:00.620
Hey, be careful and don't
drop any of your bounty!

18:00.956 --> 18:04.756
Thanks! You guys be careful
too and don't get killed!

18:10.165 --> 18:11.632
Baffle?

18:16.204 --> 18:20.004
See you guys later!

18:25.313 --> 18:27.474
I see you've chosen to take
the path of thorns!

18:27.816 --> 18:30.118
That's an excellent choice,

18:30.118 --> 18:32.177
if you plan on dying today!

18:32.654 --> 18:34.121
Ouch...

18:35.223 --> 18:41.822
I've warned countless fools before you.
You're in my world now!

18:42.397 --> 18:45.696
You shall pay the price for not
heeding my warning!

18:46.134 --> 18:47.402
Jing, look!

18:47.402 --> 18:49.199
I guess that's his real face.

18:49.638 --> 18:52.300
He must have been wearing a
human mask this whole time.

18:57.412 --> 18:59.209
This doesn't look good, Jing!

18:59.447 --> 19:01.210
Yeah, doesn't look good for him.

19:04.052 --> 19:05.610
Kir Royale!

19:19.401 --> 19:21.301
I can't believe this!

19:21.603 --> 19:24.172
This is the Madame's real face!

19:24.172 --> 19:26.308
How could you let the Bandit
King use you like that?

19:26.308 --> 19:30.779
It's all your fault! The
Vintage Smile is gone!

19:30.779 --> 19:34.613
You must hurry and get after the
Bandit King immediately!

19:36.451 --> 19:37.918
That's enough.

19:40.188 --> 19:42.315
That mask is not the
important thing here.

19:43.091 --> 19:45.821
It's all right. Everything is just fine.

20:02.177 --> 20:06.113
By the way, what happened with you
and Stir when you went to see her?

20:10.885 --> 20:13.615
Are you hiding something from me?

20:20.629 --> 20:27.501
What did you do, Jing!? Look me in
the eyes and tell me what happened!

20:45.987 --> 20:48.615
My lady, Miss Stir...

20:50.492 --> 20:54.326
I was wondering if I might have the
pleasure of waltzing with you?

20:55.163 --> 20:56.960
Oh my, it is quite kind of you to ask.

20:58.199 --> 21:00.429
But I must kindly refuse.

21:04.039 --> 21:05.631
Welcome back, Stir.

21:12.781 --> 21:15.579
I am waiting for a certain
someone to return to me.

21:16.217 --> 21:20.347
I promised myself that he would
be the next man I dance with.

21:29.097 --> 21:30.564
Thank you though.
